5,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we have no information yet, I suggest we use this time to observe everyone's communication styles. Let's keep the conversation open and see how everyone reacts.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! I'm going to find the werewolf with my super-detective skills! Who do you think is the most suspicious already?,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, it is too early for suspicions. I agree with Mizuki. We should establish a baseline of behavior before we start making accusations.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,A very sensible approach. I shall happily observe and listen. Let us maintain a peaceful atmosphere while we get to know one another.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm in! I'll be honest and friendly with everyone. I think if we all trust each other, we can figure this out together!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Trust is a luxury, Kenji. I'll be looking for contradictions and those who try to steer the narrative too early. @Sakura, your enthusiasm is high; do you have a plan?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Sakura,,My plan is to follow my heart and look for funny clues! Maybe the werewolf will accidentally tell a joke that's too scary! Hehe!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Logic is more reliable than ""funny clues."" I will be monitoring for any sudden shifts in tone or inconsistent logic as the pressure increases.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I find Sakura's spirit refreshing. However, I agree that we must remain vigilant. The most cunning wolves often hide behind the most innocent masks.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Kenji,,Masks? That sounds like a costume party! I'll just be myself. I really want us all to get along while we play!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, you have a point. The ""innocent"" role can be a powerful shield. I'll be paying close attention to who agrees with whom too quickly.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! You sound like a teacher! But I'll try to be a good detective and watch for those ""masks"" too!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, mirroring is indeed a common tactic for the Possessed. I will be analyzing the structural flow of our arguments to see if anyone is simply echoing others.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate dance. I wonder if we shall see any such echoes in our discourse, or perhaps someone attempting to lead the choir too enthusiastically.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not echoing! I just really think we should be nice to each other. Does that make me suspicious, Mizuki?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Not yet, Kenji. But remember, the werewolf will also try to appear friendly. Let's conclude today's discussion and wait for the Seer's first result.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Okay! I'm going to go dream about solving the mystery! Goodnight everyone!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I shall spend the night reflecting on these initial interactions. Goodnight.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,A peaceful night to all. I look forward to tomorrow's revelations.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight! I hope the Seer finds something super helpful tonight! See you tomorrow!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
