35,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning. The first night has passed. If the Seer feels it is safe, now is the time to share any information that can guide us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning! Did anyone have a cool dream? @Toshio, you're so quiet, did you find a secret clue last night?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and I divined Kenji. He is the werewolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a very direct and bold revelation, Toshio. To claim the role and identify the wolf immediately is a high-risk, high-reward strategy.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! No way! I'm not the werewolf! Toshio, why would you say that? I thought we were friends!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, claiming the Seer role so early is unconventional. If you are the Seer, we've won immediately. If you are the wolf, you're trying to frame Kenji.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, a fight already! Kenji looks really sad. Are you sure, Toshio? Maybe you made a mistake?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I do not make mistakes in my divinations. The result was clear. Kenji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, your reaction is emotional. While that is consistent with your personality, it does not prove your innocence.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"But I'm telling the truth! I'm just a regular human! @Mizuki, you're logical, right? You can't just believe Toshio because he says he's the Seer!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I believe in evidence. Toshio's claim is the only concrete lead we have. Unless another Seer emerges to counter-claim, the logic points toward Kenji.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Sakura,,But what if Toshio is the bad guy and he's just tricking us? That would be a super mean prank!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, if I were the werewolf, I would not expose myself as the Seer this early. It would be far more strategic to stay hidden.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Toshio's reasoning is sound. By claiming the role now, he makes himself the primary target for the werewolf tonight. It is a selfless move for the village.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not a werewolf! Please, don't vote for me! I'll do anything to prove I'm a good guy!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"We must decide. Without a counter-claim, the most logical action is to trust the Seer's result. I will vote for Kenji.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I don't like this, but if Mizuki says so... I'll vote for Kenji too, but I'm still a little sad!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The evidence is absolute. I vote for Kenji.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. The risk of ignoring a Seer's direct identification is too great. I vote for Kenji.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Kenji,,This is so unfair! I'm not the wolf! I vote for Toshio because he's lying!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
